      "writtenOn": "2025-09-15T23:10:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this a recoverable error or will we be permanently in a bad state?\n\nIf it\u0027s permanent, should we block enrollment of new templates if we haven\u0027t validated the enrollment so that we don\u0027t get into this state?",
