      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-16T13:17:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s recoverable. In normal operation, `template_newly_enrolled` is set to `FP_NO_SUCH_TEMPLATE`. After the finger is enrolled, it\u0027s set to `templ_valid`.\n\nIt\u0027s okay if we start enrollment once again, without confirming the previous template, because the template will be overwritten.",
